+	/**
+	 * Normalize a raw specialty request parameter: a null, empty, or whitespace-only
+	 * value filters nothing and yields {@code null} (the unfiltered case); any other
+	 * value is stripped of surrounding whitespace and returned whole. Unlike the owner
+	 * last-name search, a blank value must not reach the filter query — the whole-name
+	 * equality match would match no specialty, whereas the caller intends the unfiltered
+	 * directory.
+	 * @param specialty the raw request parameter, possibly null
+	 * @return the stripped whole specialty name, or {@code null} to filter nothing
